ng.\nFixed\n- A reopened Local session keeps its working directory and additional folders. Closing its tab no longer removes it from Past Conversations.\n- Click the filename on a Local plan approval card to read the full plan before approving it.\n- Permission requests from third-party ACP agents no longer crash the conversation view or prevent Desktop from reopening a session with a pending request.\n- Remote SSH now connects to hosts defined only in a custom remote.devinSSH.configFile.\n- On Windows, local edits save even when the agent uses a different capitalization for the filename.\n- Markdown previews are now supported in the Agent Command Center.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","code","coding","develop","development","editing","editor","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"通过统一界面管理本地和云端智能体集群。无需离开编辑器，即可完成规划、委派、复核及发布。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://docs.devin.ai/zh/desktop/getting-started"},{"DocumentLabel":"常见问题","DocumentUrl":"https://docs.devin.ai/zh/desktop/devin-desktop-faq"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","releaseNotesUrl":"https://docs.devin.ai/zh/desktop/changelog","tags":["代码","开发","编程","编辑","编辑器"]}},"releaseDate":"2026-11-11","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"411ee5b30152224ab652f0629684a360adabd366","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/c/CognitionAI/DevinDesktop/3.12.28/CognitionAI.DevinDesktop.installer.yaml","sha256":"13427de470286f83064180c331b3789d6fd3dd7b47e85c29f753965d6800df87"},{"path":"manifests/c/CognitionAI/DevinDesktop/3.12.28/CognitionAI.DevinDesktop.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"c3deffd723d8c81103d456ca710ca5a73bd809921c2523decc347e9bdc17e028"},{"path":"manifests/c/CognitionAI/DevinDesktop/3.12.28/CognitionAI.DevinDesktop.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"4900251c02fa5afc33dcc5b9dde